| condition | sessions | asks/task | repeated q | active s | waiting s | takeover steps | cancel | timeout | wrong approval | success | Wilson 95% | total s (all) | interruption (1-7) |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| threshold_ask | 12 | 0.00 | 0.00 | 0.0 | 0.0 | 0.00 | 0.00 | 0.00 | - | 0.67 | 0.39-0.86 | 100.0 | - |
| value_ask | 12 | 0.00 | 0.00 | 0.0 | 0.0 | 0.00 | 0.00 | 0.00 | - | 1.00 | 0.76-1.00 | 100.0 | - |

## Paired (participant_task, 12 pairs; first condition per participant {'threshold_ask': 4} - ORDER UNBALANCED: learning effects are confounded with the condition)

| metric | n | diff (value - threshold) | 95% CI | permutation p | better if |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| asks | 12 | +0.000 | +0.000..+0.000 | 1.0000 | lower |
| repeated_ratio | 12 | +0.000 | +0.000..+0.000 | 1.0000 | lower |
| active_s | 12 | +0.000 | +0.000..+0.000 | 1.0000 | lower |
| waiting_s | 12 | +0.000 | +0.000..+0.000 | 1.0000 | lower |
