| cancelled | 12 | +0.000 | +0.000..+0.000 | 1.0000 | lower |
| timed_out | 12 | +0.000 | +0.000..+0.000 | 1.0000 | lower |
| success | 12 | +0.333 | +0.083..+0.583 | 0.1250 | higher |
| total_s | 12 | +0.000 | +0.000..+0.000 | 1.0000 | lower |

Success: non-inferior within the pre-registered margin: the success difference is +0.333, one-sided 95% lower bound +0.083 > -0.100 (p = 0.0007).

Timeouts deny the one action and are recorded with their reason; they are not read as the person refusing to help.
A non-significant difference is not evidence that the two conditions burden people equally.

