# Human pilot: threshold asking vs value asking

| condition | sessions | asks/task | repeated q | active s | waiting s | takeover steps | cancel | timeout | wrong approval | success | Wilson 95% | total s (all) | interruption (1-7) |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| threshold_ask | 2 | 1.50 | 0.00 | 4.0 | 60.0 | 0.00 | 0.50 | 0.50 | - | 0.50 | 0.09-0.91 | 200.0 | - |
| value_ask | 2 | 3.50 | 0.29 | 34.2 | 120.0 | 2.00 | 0.00 | 0.50 | - | 1.00 | 0.34-1.00 | 275.0 | 2.00 |

## Paired (participant, 2 pairs; first condition per participant {'value_ask': 1, 'threshold_ask': 1})

| metric | n | diff (value - threshold) | 95% CI | permutation p | better if |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| asks | 2 | +2.000 | +2.000..+2.000 | 0.5000 | lower |
| repeated_ratio | 2 | +0.292 | +0.250..+0.333 | 0.5000 | lower |
| active_s | 2 | +30.250 | +25.000..+35.500 | 0.5000 | lower |
| waiting_s | 1 | +60.000 | +60.000..+60.000 | 1.0000 | lower |
| takeover_steps | 2 | +2.000 | +1.000..+3.000 | 0.5000 | lower |
| cancelled | 2 | -0.500 | -1.000..+0.000 | 1.0000 | lower |
| timed_out | 2 | +0.000 | -1.000..+1.000 | 1.0000 | lower |
| success | 2 | +0.500 | +0.000..+1.000 | 1.0000 | higher |
| total_s | 2 | +75.000 | -100.000..+250.000 | 1.0000 | lower |

Timeouts deny the one action and are recorded with their reason; they are not read as the person refusing to help.
A non-significant difference is not evidence that the two conditions burden people equally.

