| policy | vs | tasks | diff | 95% CI | permutation p | McNemar n01/n10 | McNemar p |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| vp_full | vp_direct | 2 | +0.000 | +0.000..+0.000 | 1.0000 | 0/0 | 1.0000 |

## Budget curve (success within wall_s budget, planned runs)

| budget | vp_direct | vp_full |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | 0.500 | 0.000 |
| 2 | 0.500 | 0.500 |

A non-significant difference is not evidence of equality; claims need a pre-registered margin.

