| vp_learned | 24 | 19 | 0.792 | 0.595-0.908 | 23 | 0.826 | 1 | 155.3 |

## Paired (task level)

| policy | vs | tasks | diff | 95% CI | permutation p | McNemar n01/n10 | McNemar p |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| vp_learned | vp_direct | 12 | +0.458 | +0.208..+0.750 | 0.0312 | 11/0 | 0.0010 |

